msg.vmplayer.nativeVmrcHelpText = "用法：vmrc.exe <URL>|0A其中 <URL> 語法為：vmrc://[<user>|7C(<ticket-type>:<ticket>)@]<host>[:<port>]/|0A   ?moid=<VM-id>[&httpproxy=<proxy server>[:<proxy port>]|0A   [&proxyuser=<proxy username>][&proxypasswd=<proxy auth password>]]|0A或格式為：vmrc://settings|0A|0A   範例：vmrc://clone:ticket@vsphere-server/?moid=42|0A   範例：vmrc://username@vsphere-server/?moid=79|0A   範例：vmrc://<host>[:port]/?moid=1&httpproxy=<server>&proxyuser=<name>|0A   範例：vmrc://settings|0A|0A提示：|0A   <proxy username> 或 <proxy auth password> 中的「&」字元|0A   必須編碼為「%26」。|0A|0A下列引數可用於 MKS 連線：|0A   &websocket=<WebSocket URL>|0A   &mksticket=<ticket>|0A   &thumbprint=<SSL thumbprint>|0A   &path=<VM path>|0A|0A   範例：vmrc://vRAserver/?thumbprint=aa:bb:cc|0A            &websocket=wss://host:443/ticket/123|0A"
